{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.CategoricalHiggsMechanism","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.CategoricalHiggsMechanism","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.DeriveFintype"],"declarations":37,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.linked_iff_ne_photon_of_higgs","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.linked_iff_ne_photon_of_higgs","kind":"theorem","line":239,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L239-L247","doc":"**Conditional consequence (§3b-cond).**  *If* the categorical Higgs\nmechanism holds, the linked bosons are exactly `W⁺, W⁻, Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.photon_projected_trace_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.photon_projected_trace_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":222,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L222-L237","doc":"**Conditional consequence (§3b-cond).**  *If* the categorical Higgs\nmechanism holds, then the photon's Hoefsmit-projected Markov trace\nvanishes whenever the scale is non-zero — derived from `mass_formula`\nand `photon_massless`, not read off a field. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.photon_massless","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.photon_massless","kind":"theorem","line":220,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L220-L220","doc":"The unbroken photon is massless. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.mass_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.mass_formula","kind":"theorem","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L218-L218","doc":"Mass = Hoefsmit-projected Markov trace of the post-breaking link. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.mass_eigenstate_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.mass_eigenstate_count","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L216-L216","doc":"Three broken generators: three `lk = 1` links, photon unlinked. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.q_generic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.q_generic","kind":"theorem","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L214-L214","doc":"Generic-`q` hypothesis: `q` is NOT a root of unity in `R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism.mk","kind":"ctor","line":207,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L207-L207","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalHiggsMechanism","kind":"class","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L180-L220","doc":"**Conjecture carrier (dependent on `WeinbergAngleCategorical`; NO\ninstance).**  `CategoricalHiggsMechanism R q A d cotW lk e β scale m`\npackages the inputs the `.md` names, each as a genuine constraint:\n\n* `[WeinbergAngleCategorical R q A d cotW]` — the upstream conjecture,\n  taken as an explicit instance binder: that binder **is** the\n  dependency edge (§3b-tax), so this carrier is classified *dependent*\n  by the vacuity audit's conjecture graph, matching the block's\n  `uses: [\"conj:weinberg-angle-categorical\"]`;\n* `q_generic` — the substrate parameter is not a root of unity;\n* `mass_eigenstate_count` — three bosons fuse with a Goldstone into a\n  2-component link with `lk = 1`; the photon does not;\n* `mass_formula` — each mass is the Hoefsmit-projected Markov trace of\n  its post-breaking link;\n* `photon_massless` — the unbroken photon's link is trivial, so its\n  mass vanishes: the Markov trace of the surviving 1-component knot\n  sandwiched by its projector is `0` in the mass channel.\n\n**Tower status (owner ruling 2026-09-03): ORDER-ZERO-ONLY** — one\nHoefsmit projection per boson at fixed `n`; the full `H_n(q)` tower\nis not used.\n\nNo instance: constructing the Goldstone-eating linking and the\npost-breaking Markov traces from the substrate is the open content\nof `conj:categorical-higgs-mechanism` (Steps A–D of the `.md`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:categorical-higgs-mechanism","label":"conj:categorical-higgs-mechanism","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.cot_identification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.cot_identification","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L176-L176","doc":"**The identification — the conjecture's claim.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.trB_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.trB_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L174-L174","doc":"The `B`-slot scalar is non-zero, so the ratio is defined. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.hecke_σ₅","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.hecke_σ₅","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L172-L172","doc":"Hecke relation `σ₅² = (q − q⁻¹) σ₅ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.hecke_σ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.hecke_σ₁","kind":"theorem","line":170,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L170-L170","doc":"Hecke relation `σ₁² = (q − q⁻¹) σ₁ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.eB_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.eB_idem","kind":"theorem","line":168,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L168-L168","doc":"Hoefsmit cell content: `e_B⁺` is a projector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.eW_idem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.eW_idem","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L166-L166","doc":"Hoefsmit cell content: `e_W⁺` is a projector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.trM_cyclic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.trM_cyclic","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L164-L164","doc":"Markov-trace cyclicity `tr_M(ab) = tr_M(ba)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical.mk","kind":"ctor","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L159-L159","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.WeinbergAngleCategorical","kind":"class","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L153-L176","doc":"**Conjecture carrier (primary, content-bearing, NO instance)** —\ninlined copy of `conj:weinberg-angle-categorical`'s class; the\nidentification `cot θ_W · tr_M(e_B⁺σ₅⁸) = tr_M(e_W⁺σ₁⁴)` over genuine\nHecke data.  Tower status: ORDER-ZERO-ONLY (single ratio at `n = 6`). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:weinberg-angle-categorical","label":"conj:weinberg-angle-categorical","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/weinberg-angle-categorical.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.trB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.trB","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L148-L149","doc":"`tr_M(e_B⁺ · σ₅⁸)` — the pre-EWSB `B`-slot trace scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.trW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.trW","kind":"def","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L145-L146","doc":"`tr_M(e_W⁺ · σ₁⁴)` — the `W`-slot trace scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.σ₅","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.σ₅","kind":"def","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L139-L139","doc":"Braid generator `σ₅` (the `H`/pre-mixing `B` slot carries `σ₅⁸`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.σ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.σ₁","kind":"def","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L137-L137","doc":"Braid generator `σ₁` (the `W` slot carries `σ₁⁴`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.eB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.eB","kind":"def","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L135-L135","doc":"Hoefsmit idempotent `e_B⁺` — symmetric channel of the pre-EWSB `B` slot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.eW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.eW","kind":"def","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L133-L133","doc":"Hoefsmit idempotent `e_W⁺` — symmetric channel of the `W` slot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.trM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.trM","kind":"def","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L131-L131","doc":"The Markov trace `tr_M : A → R` (an `R`-linear functional). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData.mk","kind":"ctor","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L129-L129","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWHoefsmitData","kind":"structure","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L127-L139","doc":"**The Hecke-eigenvalue data of the electroweak triplet at `n = 6`**\n(inlined copy — see the source file for the full docstring). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.linked_iff_ne_photon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.linked_iff_ne_photon","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L93-L121","doc":"**The three linked bosons are exactly the non-photons.**  A genuine\n(if small) consequence of `MassEigenstateCountThree`: the filter\n`{b | lk b = 1}` has three elements and omits the photon, and there\nare four bosons, so it is `univ \\ {photon}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalMassFormula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CategoricalMassFormula","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L82-L91","doc":"**The categorical mass formula** (`.md` §4): the mass of each\npost-breaking boson `X` is the Markov trace of its new 2-component\nlink `β X`, sandwiched by the appropriate Hoefsmit projector `e X`,\nup to the overall scale `scale` (the crossing energy `E_×·μ₀`,\nwhich this block does not derive):\n\n    m_X = scale · tr_M(e_X · β_X · e_X). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.MassEigenstateCountThree","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.MassEigenstateCountThree","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L73-L80","doc":"**Three broken generators, as a linking statement** (`.md` §2–3).\nGiven the linking number `lk` of each post-breaking boson's\nclosed-braid representative with its eaten Goldstone component,\nexactly three bosons carry `lk = 1` (the broken-generator\nmultiplicity) and the photon carries `lk = 0` (unbroken, still a\n1-component knot).  Content-bearing: false for most `lk`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instFintypeEWBoson","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instFintypeEWBoson","kind":"instance","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instDecidableEqEWBoson","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.instDecidableEqEWBoson","kind":"instance","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L71-L71","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.photon","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.photon","kind":"ctor","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.Z","kind":"ctor","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.Wminus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.Wminus","kind":"ctor","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.Wplus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson.Wplus","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.EWBoson","kind":"inductive","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L63-L71","doc":"The four electroweak gauge bosons of the `.md`: pre-breaking each is\na 1-component knot; post-breaking three of them fuse with a Goldstone\nboson into a 2-component link and the photon survives as a knot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.IsRootOfUnityH","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.IsRootOfUnityH","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/categorical-higgs-mechanism.lean#L56-L59","doc":"Predicate: `q : R` is a root of unity in `R` (used to state the\ngeneric-`q` hypothesis as `¬ IsRootOfUnityH q`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}